                    .as("offset of key group %d", range.getStartKeyGroup() + i)
                    .isEqualTo(expectedOffsets[i]);
        }
    }

    private static void assertDelegateData(
            KeyGroupsStateHandle handle, String expectedName, String expectedPayload) {
        final StreamStateHandle delegate = handle.getDelegateStateHandle();
        assertThat(delegate).isInstanceOf(ByteStreamStateHandle.class);
        final ByteStreamStateHandle byteStreamStateHandle = (ByteStreamStateHandle) delegate;
        assertThat(byteStreamStateHandle.getHandleName()).isEqualTo(expectedName);
        assertThat(byteStreamStateHandle.getData())
                .isEqualTo(expectedPayload.getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
    }

