 * +--------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
 * | INTERVAL DAY TO MONTH          | long (number of milliseconds)           |
 * +--------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
 * | ROW / structured types         | {@link RowData}                         |
 * +--------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
 * | ARRAY                          | {@link ArrayData}                       |
 * +--------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
 * | MAP / MULTISET                 | {@link MapData}                         |
 * +--------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
 * | RAW                            | {@link RawValueData}                    |
 * +--------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
 * | BITMAP                         | {@link Bitmap}                          |
 * +--------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
 * | UUID                           | byte[] (16 big-endian bytes)            |
